# Diagnostic probe files (safe to ignore)
.__*
__preflight_test
PROGRESS_PROBE.txt
scripts/queue/.__*

# Supervised review-only output. Never committed; uploaded as a CI artifact.
review-edition-*.md

# Daily working files for the manual publishing path. Both are regenerated
# every morning by `npm run brief:prep` and the editor pass. Committing them
# would put a full copy of other newsrooms' article text in this repository.
brief-workpacket.md
brief-drafts.json
brief-drafts.*.json
